======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 22 - CAP Theorem From First Principles
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Two nodes accepting writes without cross-network communication.

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Choose CP (reject writes on minority partition) or AP (accept writes with divergence).

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
